"seriesIds":[12101],"startDate":{"day":29,"month":6,"year":2001},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"The original video performed by hitomi (under the name Minami Hokuto) that inspired Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha. It is from Triangle Heart ~Lyrical Toy Box~, a merchandise CD released on June 29, 2001 for the eroge video game Triangle Heart 3.\n\nThe CD contains a large amount of fan material, including a number of visual novel-like stories called \"mini-scenarios\". One of them, entitled \"Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha\", cast Nanoha Takamachi (a minor character in the TH3 canon) as a magical girl and served as a prototype for the Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha anime series."},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Henshin","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha: Lyrical Toy Box","english":"Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha: Lyrical Toy Box","native":"リリカルおもちや箱","romaji":"Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha: Lyrical Toy Box","synonyms":[]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}